Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here
and today I'm breaking down Black Panther's

00:00:11.719 --> 00:00:16.040
end-credits scenes to explain how they set
up Avengers: Infinity War and I'll also be

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.750
revealing some Marvel easter eggs you might
have missed.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:23.790
If this is your first time here, I do regular
videos on Marvel movies and I'm also starting

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.640
my Black Panther Funko Pop giveaway!

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:30.360
For a chance to win, you just need to be a
